      "target": "../sections/sec-039-251-do-you-have-your-directors-agreement.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "You will need your director’s formal approval before your planning proposal or \nyour final guideline can be considered by the GRC. In addition, your ADG will \nneed to approve the final guideline after its review and approval by the GRC.",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "States that the director's formal approval is needed before the planning proposal or final guideline goes to the review committee, and that the assistant director-general must approve the final guideline afterwards.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
