      "target": "../sections/sec-081-522-human-rights.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "Attention to these areas enables WHO to more effectively deliver on its \ncommitments in its Twelfth General Programme of Work (1). This chapter \ndescribes how these important considerations can be integrated into each \nstep of the guideline development process and suggests eight entry points \nfor doing so.",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Despite its heading, contains the end of the Chapter 5 introduction, saying that attention to these areas helps WHO deliver on its programme of work. States that the chapter describes how to integrate these considerations into each guideline development step through eight entry points.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
