        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Describes step 4, in which the draft questions and outcomes are sent to the GDG and possibly other stakeholders for review and comment. The extracted text also contains the text of Figure 7.2, a flowchart of prioritizing key questions and outcomes for both foreground and background questions.",
