      "narrative": null,
      "content": "After scoping the proposed guideline (see Chapter 2) and crafting the key \nquestions (see Chapter 7), the next step in guideline development is to identify \none or more systematic reviews to address each key question. Existing systematic reviews will inform the guideline development process, whether or not \na new systematic review or an update of an existing review will be required.",
      "truncated": false,
