      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Describes step 1 of a systematic review: finalizing the key questions in PICO format and setting explicit study eligibility criteria, which are drafted and agreed by consensus between the steering group and the review team. It lists the additions to PICO for inclusion criteria, such as time frame, setting, study design, language and date range. The extraction also includes the text of Figure 8.2, which lists the six review steps.",
