      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "Guidelines that are near or beyond their “review-by” date",
      "pageStart": 175,
      "pageEnd": 176,
      "target": "../sections/sec-243-1253-guidelines-that-are-near-or-beyond-their-re.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "Technical units are responsible for keeping their guidelines up to date. As \nguidelines near their “review-by” date, they should be carefully examined \nfor currency. If there is reason to believe one or more recommendations need \nupdating, plans should be made to start that process.\nWHO handbook for guideline development\n164\n164",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "States that technical units are responsible for examining guidelines for currency as the review-by date approaches and planning updates where recommendations may need changing.",
